Aim
To write a Python program using regular expressions (re module) to validate an email ID or a 10-digit mobile number entered by the user.

Algorithm

Step-1: Start the program.
Step-2: Import the re module.
Step-3: Get an email ID or mobile number from the user.Step-4: Define a regular expression pattern for email validation.
Step-5: Define a regular expression pattern for mobile number validation.
Step-6: Use re.fullmatch() to check whether the input matches the email pattern.
Step-7: If the email pattern matches, print "Valid email id".
Step-8: Otherwise, check whether the input matches the mobile number pattern.
Step-9: If the mobile number pattern matches, print "Valid mobile number".
Step-10: Otherwise, print "Invalid email or mobile number".
Step-11: Stop the program.


